===Etymology===
From {{m|en|Lapp}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The northern parts of [[Scandinavia]] and [[Finland]] with the [[Kola Peninsula]] in [[Russia]], traditionally inhabited by the [[Sami]] people.

